<title>UK: UK refers London Clubs/Capital to MMC.</title>
<headline>UK refers London Clubs/Capital to MMC.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The UK government said on Monday that it has referred the proposed acquisition by London Clubs International Plc of gaming firm Capital Corp Plc to the monopolies and mergers commission.</p>
</text>
